Acknowledgement

All code in this repository is the authors' own; no third-party code is
redistributed here. The experiments are built on BEAST.jl and
CompScienceMeshes.jl by Kristof Cools and contributors
(https://github.com/krcools), which supply the boundary element assembly and
the RWG/BC discretizations these scripts drive. Both are used as ordinary
dependencies under their own MIT licences, and we gratefully acknowledge
them.
